title: Andrés Saborit
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, centrist
card-image: img/es/leaders/saborit.png
new-page: true
view-if: muller_advisor = 1

= Andrés Saborit

Saborit is a veteran <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> deputy and a close ally of Besteiro, a seasoned parliamentary manager of the party's orthodox-Marxist current.

- @coalition
- @toleration
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@coalition
title: Negotiating with the Coalition
subtitle: Saborit can improve our relationships with our coalition partners.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and psoe_in_government = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psoe_in_government: The <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> is not in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if psoe_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0; izq_rep_relation += 4; radical_relation += 3

We have smoothed relations with our republican coalition partners in <span style="color: #4a7d3a;">**Republican Left**</span> and the <span style="color: #d9a441;">Radical Party</span>, and reduced tensions within the coalition.


@toleration
title: Defending Toleration
subtitle: Saborit supports supporting the government from outside rather than joining it.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psoe_toleration: The <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> is not tolerating a government. ?]
choose-if: psoe_in_government = 0 and psoe_toleration = 1 and advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 8; neorevisionist_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 5;

We have reduced dissent among the factions that chafe at supporting a government we do not lead.

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Saborit" : Saborit must head the government. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and chancellor == "Saborit"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12;

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].
